Human Powers
============
	As bestowed by the gods, who in their infinite wisdom
  saw that even humans deserved a chance....


command: missile, shock or fireball.
argument: optional name of a creature

Cast a spell. If no argument, then cast spell on current fighting opponent.

Spell		Cost (in spell points)	Damage     Abbreviation  
missile			10		 1-20		mi
shock			20		 1-30		sh
fireball		50		 1-20		fi

Each spell is a skill, with its chance of success calculated from your
intelligence (initially). Casting a spell precludes you from also
fighting in combat.

If you cast a spell on an idle creature, a fight will start.
Fireball hits all other living creatures in the room!

